1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:19,970
Timing and subtitles by the 🌃 Dreamers beyond Magic 🦄 Team @viki.com

2
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:25,200
♫ The burning in the intersection between dark and light ♫

3
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:28,580
♫ The wandering of dreams in reality ♫

4
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:30,720
♫ The path of magic is filled with too many thorns ♫

5
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:35,560
♫ To penetrate the chest in the long river of fate ♫

6
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:38,200
♫ To sail against the current with no fear of curses ♫

7
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:41,460
♫ To fight against the unfair axis of fate, we start on our journey ♫

8
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:43,540
♫ Fly high ♫

9
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:47,940
♫ Passing by the hill of our dreams ♫

10
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:52,300
♫ Brighter sky, whose eyes did we scorch? ♫

11
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:56,620
♫ To unlock the ordinary and reveal the confusing secrets ♫

12
00:00:56,620 --> 00:01:01,060
♫ A belief that has never changed ♫

13
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:08,020
♫ Our dreams and hearts are interlocked; we reverse time and space ♫

14
00:01:08,020 --> 00:01:11,620
♫ Wandering at the end of darkness ♫

15
00:01:11,620 --> 00:01:14,000
♫ Changing identities in rebirth at the dead end ♫

16
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,120
♫ Watching the inferno rip across the horizon ♫

17
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:19,700
♫ Waiting for the time to awaken ♫

18
00:01:19,700 --> 00:01:22,360
♫ Oh, my life ♫

19
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:27,840
♫ Overturn fate and become the master of magic, creating new rules ♫

20
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:42,940
[Full-time Magister: Season 1, Episode 1]

21
00:01:45,780 --> 00:01:48,740
I'm Mo Fan, and I'm a ninth-grader.

22
00:01:48,740 --> 00:01:50,460
[City-wide High School Entrance Exam]

23
00:01:50,460 --> 00:01:55,800
The high school entrance exam I just took almost made me die inside.

24
00:01:55,800 --> 00:02:00,180
It's not because I'm a completely underachieving student,

25
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:16,510
but because the exam content was on magic!

26
00:02:17,220 --> 00:02:19,300
- Let's go home!
- We are finally done with the exam!

27
00:02:21,660 --> 00:02:24,880
- It's finally over!
- Let's go and have some fun!

28
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:29,640
While wearing this pendant, I fell asleep in the back mountain three months ago.

29
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:39,560
Thus, everything became like this.

30
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:42,460
Everybody around me talks about magic.

31
00:02:44,700 --> 00:02:47,120
Hey, isn't that Mo Fan?

32
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:49,460
He even turned his exam in early.

33
00:02:49,460 --> 00:02:52,660
I don't think he understood what the questions were about.

34
00:02:52,660 --> 00:02:55,540
Now that you mention it, the exam this time was quite difficult.

35
00:02:55,540 --> 00:02:59,840
For the last question about the seven uses of the elementary levels of light magic,

36
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,540
I couldn't answer it completely.

37
00:03:01,540 --> 00:03:06,200
Mu Bai, your grades are so good. You must have gotten a perfect score.

38
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:11,720
It's just an entrance exam on the basic theory of magic to get into Magic Senior High School.

39
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:15,240
What's important is the type of element we will control when our magic awakens.

40
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:19,500
Of course, those who don't pass will never have the hope of becoming a magician.

41
00:03:19,500 --> 00:03:21,200
Mu Bai, you are so amazing.

42
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:24,020
You are from the prominent ice-controlling Mu Clan.

43
00:03:24,020 --> 00:03:27,200
You'll definitely awaken control of ice!

44
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:28,500
An ice magician is powerful!

45
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:30,500
I hope to awaken that, too.

46
00:03:30,500 --> 00:03:32,040
Controlling fire is much stronger,

47
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:34,880
but awakening that element is rare.

48
00:03:34,880 --> 00:03:38,060
But I heard one element is the most powerful...

49
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:43,100
[Bo City's Water Orchid Middle School]

50
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:55,100
Dad, what are you doing here?

51
00:03:55,100 --> 00:03:56,280
I came to pick you up.

52
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:58,880
How did your magic exam go?

53
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,720
It was such a mess.

54
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:03,880
I studied the basic theory of magic for only three months,

55
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:06,660
but I was tested on nine years of material.

56
00:04:06,660 --> 00:04:08,520
How could it go well?

57
00:04:09,060 --> 00:04:12,920
Don't worry, I found you a job as a driver in the neighboring city.

58
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:17,060
Your uncle, Guang Feng, will help care for you. The starting salary isn't bad either.

59
00:04:17,060 --> 00:04:19,060
You can earn around 4,000-5,000 yuan ($500-700) a month.

60
00:04:19,060 --> 00:04:22,120
It's not a bad thing to start working young.

61
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:24,180
Dad, I want to study!

62
00:04:24,180 --> 00:04:27,020
No, I want to study magic!

63
00:04:27,020 --> 00:04:29,900
I know there are good prospects in studying magic.

64
00:04:29,900 --> 00:04:33,660
You have high aspirations and don't want to become a driver like me.

65
00:04:33,660 --> 00:04:36,100
But you should know what your grades are like.

66
00:04:36,100 --> 00:04:40,380
You are 300-400 points from making the minimum level to get into Magic Senior High School.

67
00:04:40,380 --> 00:04:42,320
I really want to learn!

68
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:46,220
Whether I am in my original world or this magic world,

69
00:04:46,220 --> 00:04:49,980
I don't want to become a person others look down on or who accomplishes nothing in life.

70
00:04:49,980 --> 00:04:54,660
If you want to study magic, I'll think of something.

71
00:04:54,660 --> 00:04:56,520
Dad, thank you!

72
00:04:56,520 --> 00:05:01,380
I'll surely become a famous, respected magician who stands out among others!

73
00:05:02,660 --> 00:05:05,040
Good. Let's go home!

74
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:09,880
[Bo City's Water Orchid Middle School]

75
00:05:21,100 --> 00:05:24,820
By the way, Brother Fan, our little princess, Mu Ning Xue is back from the Capital.

76
00:05:24,820 --> 00:05:27,580
I saw her this morning.

77
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:31,260
She is even prettier than before.

78
00:05:31,260 --> 00:05:32,560
Oh.

79
00:05:33,260 --> 00:05:35,260
Brother Fan, why don't you have a reaction?

80
00:05:35,260 --> 00:05:37,080
How should I react?

81
00:05:39,700 --> 00:05:41,840
Brother Fan, wait for me!

82
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:45,680
Brother Fan, why aren't you a bit excited?

83
00:05:50,300 --> 00:05:53,920
Old Brother Mu He, please do me a favor.

84
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:57,020
I'm begging you.

85
00:05:57,020 --> 00:06:02,220
With a word of yours, my son can get admitted into Magic Senior High.

86
00:06:02,220 --> 00:06:06,440
Mo Jia Xing, I can forget how your son lazed around and never studied properly,

87
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:10,580
but he dared to run away with Old Master Mu Zhuo Yun's beloved daughter.

88
00:06:10,580 --> 00:06:14,340
Just based on that, why should I help you?

89
00:06:14,340 --> 00:06:18,840
It was indeed our Mo Fan's fault for being insensible. He shouldn't have caused such trouble.

90
00:06:18,840 --> 00:06:24,200
Luckily, we found them and brought her back very soon. In the end, nothing bad happened.

91
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:26,400
Young Miss was fine.

92
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:30,640
No matter what, just based on how many years I have served the Mu Family,

93
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:32,340
just help me one last time!

94
00:06:32,340 --> 00:06:34,060
He really wants to study magic.

95
00:06:34,060 --> 00:06:37,240
It's too late if he couldn't pass the test in.

96
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:41,200
If you knew this day would come, you should have educated him better early on.

97
00:06:41,200 --> 00:06:45,260
If I didn't speak on your behalf last time, you would have packed your things and left long ago.

98
00:06:45,260 --> 00:06:48,140
As a good-for-nothing child, it's fine if he doesn't understand.

99
00:06:48,140 --> 00:06:51,680
But as a father, who is a seasoned worker in society,

100
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:56,880
do you still not understand you can't have a relationship with some people due to their higher social class?

101
00:06:58,460 --> 00:07:00,900
He really wants to become a magician.

102
00:07:00,900 --> 00:07:06,340
Old Brother Mu He, if you help me this time, I can agree to anything.

103
00:07:06,340 --> 00:07:08,320
You were the one to say that.

104
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:11,040
Actually, Old Master Mu never wanted you to live nearby.

105
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:14,960
You should know how expensive it is to buy admittance to Magic Senior High.

106
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:17,500
Even with money, he may not get in.

107
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:20,760
How about this? If you can pledge your house to me, I will consider it.

108
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:23,480
Must I give my old home to you?

109
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:27,520
Your house is simply garbage. What's expensive is the land value.

110
00:07:30,260 --> 00:07:33,020
All right.

111
00:07:35,740 --> 00:07:37,740
What has changed about the world?

112
00:07:37,740 --> 00:07:39,360
It is still so cruel.

113
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:42,200
Those without status or power are manipulated by such people.

114
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:45,960
Mo Fan, let me tell you some good news!

115
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:49,200
I was able to settle the matter of you getting into Magic Senior High.

116
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:51,100
- Eat.
- Did you?

117
00:07:51,100 --> 00:07:55,020
One of my old classmates just happens to be a director at the school.

118
00:07:55,020 --> 00:07:57,880
When I talked with him, he agreed right away.

119
00:07:57,880 --> 00:08:00,880
Promise me you will study harder.

120
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:02,940
Mo Fan, I believe in you!

121
00:08:02,940 --> 00:08:04,440
Okay.

122
00:08:05,747 --> 00:08:07,440
By the way,

123
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:10,660
I plan to rent out our house when you are in school.

124
00:08:10,660 --> 00:08:14,740
Anyway, I'm out driving and Xin Xia lives at school.

125
00:08:14,740 --> 00:08:20,200
Once you go to high school, you'll live at school as well. It would be a waste if the house was left empty.

126
00:08:20,200 --> 00:08:21,680
Okay.

127
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:24,960
That... I heard Young Miss is back.

128
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:29,360
Dad, all I am thinking of is studying hard in magic school.

129
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:32,520
In the future, I will earn a lot of money for you and Xin Xia to spend.

130
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:34,680
And I will buy many houses that you can choose to live in.

131
00:08:34,680 --> 00:08:38,660
I will become a great, respected magician!

132
00:08:38,660 --> 00:08:41,100
Good! Good!

133
00:08:53,780 --> 00:08:56,840
[Mu Ning Xue]

134
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:04,960
Oh...

135
00:09:12,420 --> 00:09:14,600
Mo Fan, let's go.

136
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:17,880
Where should we go?

137
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:21,660
We can go anywhere. I don't want to stay at that home any longer.

138
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:25,100
All right then.

139
00:09:37,220 --> 00:09:41,120
Mo Jia Xing! Your son is so brave!

140
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:43,200
He dared to elope with Young Miss.

141
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:45,580
Does he not want to live anymore?

142
00:09:45,580 --> 00:09:47,720
I'm sorry! It's all my fault!

143
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:49,720
You can do anything to me.

144
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:53,640
Don't make things difficult for Mo Fan. He's just an insensible child.

145
00:09:56,260 --> 00:09:57,620
How is he insensible?

146
00:09:57,620 --> 00:09:59,400
He is clearly very sensible!

147
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:03,140
He knows how to curry favors of those with influence and bewitch my daughter!

148
00:10:03,140 --> 00:10:05,600
Mo Fan, this is my last warning to you.

149
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:10,740
If you dare to show up in front of her again, I'll break your legs!

150
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:30,280
Students, it's this semesters first day at Sky Waves Magic Senior High.
[Welcome New Students]

151
00:10:30,280 --> 00:10:32,660
Welcome to an all-new magic school!

152
00:10:32,660 --> 00:10:35,900
I didn't think we will have our magic awakening the first day of school.

153
00:10:35,900 --> 00:10:37,360
I'm so nervous!

154
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:38,420
That's right!

155
00:10:38,420 --> 00:10:40,560
I want most to be a wind-element magician.

156
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:43,540
Hopefully, I can successfully awaken the wind element.

157
00:10:43,540 --> 00:10:46,740
No way! What's the use of the wind element? A fire element is stronger.

158
00:10:46,740 --> 00:10:50,380
- But only a few people can awaken the fire element.
- Brother, don't pull such a long face. You can do it!

159
00:10:50,380 --> 00:10:53,260
- Only 2-3 in each class awakens it.
- You'll awaken a powerful element! You surely can!

160
00:10:53,260 --> 00:10:56,380
[Sky Waves Magic Senior High School]

161
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:02,140
This school badge is very important.
[Class 8, Grade 10]

162
00:11:02,140 --> 00:11:05,940
Students, when you awaken your own element,

163
00:11:05,940 --> 00:11:08,400
your school badge will change to its corresponding color.
[Sky]

164
00:11:08,400 --> 00:11:14,160
For example, cyan corresponds to wind, red corresponds to fire,

165
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:17,340
and gold corresponds to light.

166
00:11:20,580 --> 00:11:22,080
What?

167
00:11:25,800 --> 00:11:28,780
No. 48, Mo Fan, the last one.

168
00:11:28,780 --> 00:11:31,240
You're lucky to even sit here.

169
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:33,737
You used your connections to get in!

170
00:11:34,660 --> 00:11:37,020
You lackey! Why are you an evil influence who never leaves?

171
00:11:37,020 --> 00:11:40,280
Who doesn't know that Mo Fan could never get in based on his grades?

172
00:11:40,280 --> 00:11:44,540
He'll really embarrass himself if he can't awaken an element.

173
00:11:44,540 --> 00:11:45,860
Brother Fan, ignore him.

174
00:11:45,860 --> 00:11:47,860
You can surely awaken a powerful element!

175
00:11:47,860 --> 00:11:49,100
"A powerful element"?

176
00:11:49,100 --> 00:11:52,900
He should burn incense, pray to Buddha, and thank his ancestors if he even awakens the weakest light element.

177
00:11:52,900 --> 00:11:56,640
He can't compare with our Mu Bai!

178
00:12:02,700 --> 00:12:06,160
Mu Bai, place your right hand on the Awakening Stone and have no distracting thoughts.

179
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:07,760
I understand.

180
00:12:10,420 --> 00:12:12,160
Are you from the Mu Family?

181
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:14,420
I hope you'll awaken the ice element.

182
00:12:14,420 --> 00:12:16,120
You may start.

183
00:12:31,420 --> 00:12:33,160
- So amazing!
- He has an ice element!

184
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:36,560
- That's right!
- Mu Bai is indeed an ice magician.

185
00:12:43,180 --> 00:12:45,220
After your element is awakened, the stars on the school badge

186
00:12:45,220 --> 00:12:47,440
will show your talent in your element.

187
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:51,800
Normal people have seven dark stars after awakening an element.

188
00:12:51,800 --> 00:12:55,000
But Mu Bai already has a star that is lit up.

189
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:59,400
It means his ice element talent is higher than an average person.

190
00:12:59,400 --> 00:13:01,580
He's handsome and talented!

191
00:13:02,400 --> 00:13:04,540
- He's also smart!
- Wow!

192
00:13:04,540 --> 00:13:07,440
I'm so jealous! I want to awaken an ice element, too.

193
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:13,860
Why am I again in the same class with this loser?

194
00:13:13,860 --> 00:13:17,940
That's good too. My talent will make him so ashamed to even show his face.

195
00:13:17,940 --> 00:13:21,040
That's enough. Next up is No. 2.

196
00:13:22,300 --> 00:13:24,080
[Wind]

197
00:13:28,580 --> 00:13:30,240
[Earth]

198
00:13:33,660 --> 00:13:35,500
[Water]

199
00:13:39,660 --> 00:13:41,320
[Light]

200
00:13:45,380 --> 00:13:49,140
Everyone else didn't have a lit-up star on their badge.

201
00:13:51,900 --> 00:13:53,180
It's almost my turn.

202
00:13:53,180 --> 00:13:55,440
No. 48, Mo Fan.

203
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:57,640
So he's Mo Fan.

204
00:13:57,640 --> 00:14:00,140
- I heard he got in through connections.
- That's right!

205
00:14:00,140 --> 00:14:04,180
So if you awake a light or water element, you shouldn't feel sad.

206
00:14:04,180 --> 00:14:07,320
Look, someone at the very bottom is here.

207
00:14:14,700 --> 00:14:18,360
All right, put your right hand on the Awakening Stone.

208
00:14:26,180 --> 00:14:30,300
Don't be nervous and keep your hand steady. Otherwise, it won't work.

209
00:14:36,360 --> 00:14:38,480
So he was the student placed in this class last minute.

210
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:43,140
I hope he won't fail to awaken an element, or people will mock me as a teacher.

211
00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:49,760
Anything is good,

212
00:14:49,760 --> 00:14:51,000
even a light element.

213
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:53,280
Anything is better than nothing!

214
00:15:21,900 --> 00:15:24,020
That's strange. Why is it purple?

215
00:15:24,020 --> 00:15:28,060
Cyan is wind, blue is water, brown is earth,

216
00:15:28,060 --> 00:15:31,150
gold for light, and red for fire.

217
00:15:31,150 --> 00:15:33,160
What the blast? What is purple?

218
00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:34,320
Thunder element! It's the thunder element!

219
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:35,800
Someone awoke the thunder element!

220
00:15:35,800 --> 00:15:39,240
- What? A thunder element?
- Really?

221
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:40,460
- Let's go see.
- No way!

222
00:15:40,460 --> 00:15:43,820
A one-in-a-thousand chance of a thunder element has appeared!

223
00:15:43,820 --> 00:15:45,240
It's really the thunder element!

224
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:48,360
Of all the students, only he has the thunder element.

225
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:50,220
- So amazing!
- Why did you say fire element is strongest?

226
00:15:50,220 --> 00:15:53,240
It can't compete at all with the thunder element.

227
00:15:55,940 --> 00:15:57,680
Does someone actually have the thunder element?

228
00:15:57,680 --> 00:15:59,780
Class Seven's teacher will be well promoted.

229
00:15:59,780 --> 00:16:03,840
After all, the thunder element is the most powerful.

230
00:16:09,071 --> 00:16:10,069
- Make way!
- Make way!

231
00:16:10,069 --> 00:16:12,473
- Don't push!
- Let me see. It's really the thunder element.

232
00:16:12,473 --> 00:16:13,901
- Please make way!
- Don't push!

233
00:16:13,901 --> 00:16:15,927
- Let us all take a look.
- It really is the thunder element.

234
00:17:00,030 --> 00:17:10,000
Timing and subtitles by the 🌃 Dreamers beyond Magic 🦄 Team @viki.com

235
00:17:12,240 --> 00:17:16,480
♫ Standing at the edge of the world ♫

236
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:21,780
♫ Looking up to the most dazzling point of light in the sky ♫

237
00:17:21,780 --> 00:17:24,820
♫ Never giving up on an already-decided belief ♫

238
00:17:24,820 --> 00:17:29,900
♫ Guarding the scorching hot flame inside our hearts to never die out ♫

239
00:17:29,900 --> 00:17:33,240
♫ Never to retreat ♫

240
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:36,200
♫ A flower that never withers away ♫

241
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:38,980
♫ What is currently sprouting? ♫

242
00:17:38,980 --> 00:17:41,860
♫ Seeking the far-off light named "Hope" ♫

243
00:17:41,860 --> 00:17:44,980
♫ We navigate the road ahead ♫

244
00:17:44,980 --> 00:17:47,660
♫ The swaying flower ♫

245
00:17:47,660 --> 00:17:50,180
♫ Its struggle before withering away ♫

246
00:17:50,180 --> 00:17:52,180
♫ The sand blown by the wind filled with thistles ♫

247
00:17:52,180 --> 00:17:55,420
